{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fa2bdf8e7a25dd5cf1cdcf02c8815c2355fa7eef8a4dc029c7b9525ffa4e3ba5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89953eae31af64317ddbb920bd3524ed647ca0aaa07f4b15e029e38972414921",
      "text": "前阵子拍摄的事我想跟你聊聊，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8857d4799b23b38d7ecb79bbe45401bc6b7390b9f438d459482ae69d927a9b04",
      "text": "可能是因为经常看到宣传海报吧，\n我又想去游乐园了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4b83236c983a290da81c0502740050e7dc62ecdba4b2cd49ad9536e75864c46",
      "text": "下次再去的时候，我打算把玄武他们也叫上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf372209c02abca48951767bba879bec7627b7db47c0a7259514080cc2226e50",
      "text": "刚才招待券\n送到事务所了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707216aca24680983a72bb1236226b92dfe2902103027a91a9386b5f1679e150",
      "text": "真的假的！？这么说，又能去游乐园了吗！\n这次可以尽情玩个痛快了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3db4b550dae749c2ff2599e327ef77204da572b3ddcf824e8ecb7ace04fac12",
      "text": "毕竟这次是作为客人去嘛。\n说不定还能发现新的游玩方式呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07e3de4e9944297283708e0110e90a2c5db2397629d7b13db02c0e67f19fd4ab",
      "text": "您很喜欢\n那个游乐设施呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:610dde387284a54fd6c32c9e92f6de49b9e1db67cc8fa82263b2043eb1030d3c",
      "text": "就算又有宣传委托\n也没问题了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:099a62fee1472ab89b48c6954f96ad18f01566694198c0c137b0a310d37b298d",
      "text": "那可不！可不单单是因为工作做了宣传而已哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f5709a8e80c86f7117b63d632dc378e376edae5174190e160abfc14097a8ec",
      "text": "感受到了工作人员们火热的灵魂，\n我已经成了那家游乐园的粉丝了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65a4dfdbc2b42e33f36d668a6620eb9dfb697d728f1ef3ba780397fb80d7718a",
      "text": "哈哈，确实啊！为了让大家觉得以后还想托付给我，今后我也会继续加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:025suz_401_2_4_025_01_09_a:2_4_025_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ca6da77994a1aa0bbd4b57403ac3e132fa0c39d3c95df5c0040ff91b80993f",
      "text": "噢噢噢，燃起来了！制作人要是\n有时间的话，也跟我们一起去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
